### 0-1. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 0-2. 로그인 (토큰 발급)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 1-1. 토큰 없이 /test (막혀야 정상)
GET http://localhost:8080/test


### 2-1. JWT로 그룹 생성 (POST /groups)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NTM2NDA5MywiZXhwIjoxNzY1MzY3NjkzfQ.CDjpq8XfjI89veitfBYC4-UVFoBGc3Ie-R8KVsvIHz4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 999,             // 지금은 무시됨
  "name": "첫 번째 그룹",
  "description": "JWT로 만든 그룹입니다."
}

### 2-2. 그룹 상세 조회 (GET /groups/{id})
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NTM2MzgwMywiZXhwIjoxNzY1MzY3NDAzfQ.pdq7bDHURUrILfAplzyRRw_nRmrJA_n_QAGwTyBoFWI


### 3-1. JWT로 할 일 생성 (POST /tasks)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc2NTM2MzgwMywiZXhwIjoxNzY1MzY3NDAzfQ.pdq7bDHURUrILfAplzyRRw_nRmrJA_n_QAGwTyBoFWI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "title": "JWT 연동 테스트 할 일",
  "description": "내 그룹에만 생성돼야 합니다.",
  "status": "TODO",           // TaskStatus enum 값과 맞춰서 사용
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31"     // LocalDate 형식
}


